PSICHIC+ ligand featurization
Copyright 2023-2026 Huan Yee Koh

Ported from huankoh/psichic-plus mol_featurizer at commit 3c8e5e4.
The normalization and graph algorithms retain their original behavior.
Native loaders use installed extensions instead of compiling at import.

src/psichic_ligand/normalization/papyrus_structure_pipeline contains the
Papyrus structure pipeline 0.0.5 subset, under the MIT license.
Its standardizer uses the local ChEMBL subset and native tautomer picker.
The original license is retained in that directory.

src/psichic_ligand/normalization/chembl_structure_pipeline contains the
ChEMBL structure pipeline 1.2.4 subset, under the MIT license.
The vendored standardizer accepts the native tautomer picker.
The original license and salts/solvents data are retained in that directory.

normalization/native/tautomer_ext.cpp includes adapted RDKit
Release_2024_03_3 code under its BSD license.
The license is retained in licenses/RDKit-BSD-3-Clause.txt.
The PSICHIC+ non-commercial research license is retained in LICENSE.
